  <name>Culm</name>
  <summary>Addon manager for World of Warcraft: Forever</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Culm finds your World of Warcraft: Forever clients in Wine, Proton, Faugus, Lutris and Bottles prefixes and keeps
      their addons up to date from CurseForge, WowUp Hub and GitHub.
    </p>
    <p>
      It also cleans up the game cache, backs up your settings and can take over what WowUp installed.
      Culm is a community project, not affiliated with or endorsed by Blizzard.
    </p>
  </description>
